{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmmyk1s6wk00","created":1793849443579,"text":"5 GPS卫星定位基本原理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmmyl7txg340","created":1793849535109,"text":"伪距测量","expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn1fxwhnow0","created":1793857585004,"text":"伪距法定位是接收机在同一时刻测出四颗卫星伪距及已知的卫星坐标，采用距离交会的方法求定接收机天线所在点的三维坐标","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmn2fqfxghk0","created":1793860389877,"text":"不同卫星的测距码正交（可能并不是完全正交），所以不同卫星测距码内积为零（或者值很小趋近于零），这样就区分出了不同通道（码分系统）","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmn2k8vizts0","created":1793860743457,"text":"接收机持续产生对应卫星的测距码，并且调整它的延迟与接收到的卫星测距码进行相关，时刻保持相关系数最大，输出延迟时间，即有了计算伪距的基础","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmmylkj3zc00","created":1793849562753,"text":"载波相位测量","expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn2r2e45a00","created":1793861277893,"text":"高精度测量需要","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmn2sahjwns0","created":1793861373879,"text":"首先需要重建载波","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn37wr61200","created":1793862597812,"text":"码相关法","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn38tf76ns0","created":1793862668923,"text":"需要知道测距码结构","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn3801a2sg0","created":1793862604954,"text":"平方法（针对L2载波）","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn382eh2co0","created":1793862610106,"text":"波长减半，模糊度固定更加困难","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmn38d2s0gg0","created":1793862633343,"text":"导航电文无了","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmn38gql9dc0","created":1793862641313,"text":"信噪比差","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn397w9cg80","created":1793862700429,"text":"GPS现代化以后，L2上调制了L2C码，码结构是知道的，L5结构也知道","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn3acakso00","created":1793862788366,"text":"载波相位测量的基本原理","expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn3bqqrnu80","created":1793862898184,"text":"相位","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn3brydzko0","created":1793862900822,"text":"弧度","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmn3bt6t14w0","created":1793862903508,"text":"角度","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmn3bu672ds0","created":1793862905647,"text":"周","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn3bwtphwo0","created":1793862911423,"text":"GPS中使用周，乘以波长即得到距离","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn3e9ifvu80","created":1793863095768,"text":"接收机产生一个频率相同的载波","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn3fu2ika80","created":1793863218881,"text":"计算该载波与卫星发射载波的周数差（相位差，包含整数和小数部分）","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn3hhodba80","created":1793863348633,"text":"首次观测值","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn3iujm38g0","created":1793863455008,"text":"鉴相器","expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn3j084xk80","created":1793863467375,"text":"求出复制载波和接收载波的相位","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn3jk1mli00","created":1793863510517,"text":"用这两个相位做差","expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn3jywlrtk0","created":1793863542865,"text":"计算不不足一周的部分计算出来","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn3kmm9l080","created":1793863594482,"text":"接收机到卫星之间多少个整数周还不知道","expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn3kygt8hc0","created":1793863620274,"text":"这个整周叫做“整周模糊度”","font-weight":"bold","background":"#ff0000","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn3m0ehan40","created":1793863702851,"text":"后续观测值","expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn3me9y7880","created":1793863733052,"text":"后续距离变化的整周可以确定下来","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmn3n2bqosw0","created":1793863785403,"text":"这个周数叫做“整周计数”","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn3s26lk1c0","created":1793864176913,"text":"存在问题","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn3s55f4yg0","created":1793864183372,"text":"整周模糊度问题","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmn3shjhppc0","created":1793864210344,"text":"整周跳变","font-weight":"bold","background":"#ff0000","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn3sz9gzkw0","created":1793864248920,"text":"信号短暂被遮挡会影响整周计数，会出现跳变","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn5n0k6axs0","created":1793869423779,"text":"单差、双差、三差","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn5shazjmo0","created":1793869852050,"text":"单差、双差、三差，就是把不同的观测值逐层相减，消除其中共同的误差","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmn5nrdgas00","created":1793869482146,"text":"单差","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmr4w1uw0qw0","created":1794273550598,"text":"卫星间求一次差"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmr4w98e75k0","created":1794273566652,"text":"接收机间求一次差","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn5ochloyo0","created":1793869528109,"text":"同一颗卫星，不同接收机之间观测值作差（可以是伪距也可以是载波相位观测）","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmr4wgnmp0g0","created":1794273582811,"text":"不同历元间求一次差"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmn5std98rs0","created":1793869878308,"text":"消除卫星钟差","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn5o0ymt8w0","created":1793869503017,"text":"双差","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn5uz4x1jc0","created":1793870047593,"text":"两个接收机对不同卫星的单差再进行求差","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmn5ybdd2340","created":1793870309317,"text":"可消除接收机误差","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn5o3796x40","created":1793869507892,"text":"三差","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmn5yi4urds0","created":1793870324040,"text":"不同时间的双差再进行求差","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmn68og9zio0","created":1793871121433,"text":"通过作差减少多于参数，减少计算量","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmmylwexqjs0","created":1793849588622,"text":"整周跳变的探测及修复","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmr5u64086g0","created":1794276224238,"text":"用观测值及其线性组合的时间序列是否符合变化规律进行探测和修复"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmr605sctu00","created":1794276693718,"text":"屏幕扫描法"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmr5vphqcy00","created":1794276344791,"text":"用双频P码伪距观测值来探测、修复周跳"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmr5wfcgoww0","created":1794276401069,"text":"用观测值残差进行检验"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmmymcuayrs0","created":1793849624379,"text":"GPS绝对定位与相对定位","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmmymue16g00","created":1793849662578,"text":"差分GPS定位原理","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmmyn32msm80","created":1793849681479,"text":"CORS及网络RTK技术","layout":null},"children":[]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue-compat","version":"1.4.43"}